{
  "info": {
    "name": "My Collection — Backend (Ugartino Digital)",
    "description": "CRUD de las tablas maestras del backend: Listar, Listar Estado, Listar ID, Eliminar Lógico, Restaurar Lógico, Crear y Editar.\n\n1. Levanta el backend en http://localhost:8080.\n2. Ejecuta primero **Login (administrador)**: guarda el token.\n3. Ejecuta cada carpeta en orden (o Run collection). Cada carpeta crea su propio registro y lo edita, elimina y restaura.\n\nEstado: A = activo, I = inactivo (en Usuarios: Activo / Inactivo). Listar Estado acepta A, I o T (todos).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "docenteId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "estudianteId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "usuarioId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "cursoId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "gradoSeccionId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "aulaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "profesorId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "dni",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "sufijo",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Login (administrador)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"perfil\": \"administrador\",\n  \"correo\": \"admin@ie20191.edu.pe\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"123456\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", r.token);",
              "pm.test(\"Devuelve el token\", () => pm.expect(r.token).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
